Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:02.80,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Uno de los primeros\Nvistazos extra a GTA 6
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.82,0:00:05.51,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}no salió de Rockstar,\Nsino de South Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:08.95,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}En el episodio Guinea\NPig on a Stick, emitido
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.97,0:00:11.72,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}el 28 de octubre,\Naparecieron diecisiete
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.74,0:00:14.55,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}segundos seguidos de\Njuego real de GTA 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.93,0:00:15.88,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Qué se veía?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.90,0:00:17.88,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}A Jason recogiendo\Nuna bolsa de
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.90,0:00:19.93,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}excrementos de\Nperro del suelo y
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.95,0:00:22.34,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}usándola para golpear\Na un transeúnte.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.36,0:00:23.42,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Muy South Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.79,0:00:25.06,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Y no era un montaje:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.08,0:00:27.36,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Rockstar Games aparecía\Nen los créditos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:29.61,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}del episodio con un\Nagradecimiento por
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.85,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}ceder las imágenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.22,0:00:33.04,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Lo habías visto?\NComenta.
